% asdg
# synth_hf.ped -- smallest pedigree on which independent Lacy and Boichard
# founder-number estimators can be compared on a half-founder.
#
# Boichard routines read the input generation field `gen` (pedformat `g`),
# not inferred `igen`. This file therefore carries an explicit generation
# column so the reference population is well-defined.
#
# TOPOLOGY.  1, 2, 3 are founders.  4 = 1 x 2.  5 has sire 3 and an unknown
# dam -- the only half-founder.  6 and 7 = 4 x 5, generation 3 (study group).
#
# MEASURED:
#   a_effective_founders_boichard          4.0
#   effective_founders_lacy(mode='phantom') 4.0
#
# The two papers agree numerically here. That is not a proof that they
# implement the same half-founder rule in general.
1 0 0 1
2 0 0 1
3 0 0 1
4 1 2 2
5 3 0 2
6 4 5 3
7 4 5 3
